# BUZZBOLT: wave 3 is the spike and the last boss is not. Each fought alone
# by the demo player, the Sporeheart's aimed fans put fewer shots on the
# screen, on average, than the Queen Tick's rings and fans (yet plenty:
# ten or more). The order of whole waves, 1 < 2 < 3 and wave 3 above all
# the rest, is checked in the full runs (bzz_24 ... bzz_26).
game buzzbolt
# the opening: A skips it
press A
cheat run 2
cheat god
cheat wave 3
cheat boss
botuntil boss_dead == 1 8000
cheat wave 5
waituntil boss_count == 1 300
botuntil boss_dead == 1 9000
print es_avg3
print es_avg5
expect es_lt_53 == 1
expect es_avg5 >= 100
